// Conformance fixture for ta.stdev (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.34, Wave 5B-3).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's stdev formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_stdev.csv `close`).
// ta.stdev(source, length) uses biased (population) variance by default,
// then math.sqrt — matching Pine's documented behaviour. Warmup: first
// (length-1) bars are NA.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_stdev", overlay=false)
plot(ta.stdev(close, 4), title="stdev4")
